  "comments": "<p><strong><u>1931</u></strong><br><u>F. 192/1</u> Curved trial, with grape and without fruit<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5e90771ebfa8c.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5e90771ebfa8c.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br><u>F. 192/2</u> Straight trial, with grapes and with fruit<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5e9077dc00d95.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5e9077dc00d95.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br><strong>Trial variety with fruit rarer</strong><br><u>F. 192/3</u> Without grapes and without fruit<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5e9078fb38910.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5e9078fb38910.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br><u>F. 192/4 </u>With grapes and without fruit<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5e907b0a34b1a.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5e907b0a34b1a.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br><u>F. 192/5</u> With grapes and with fruit<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5e907dc3697a4.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5e907dc3697a4.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br><br><strong><u>1932</u></strong><br><u>F. 192/6</u> Trial, 9 and 2 close, without grapes and without fruit<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5e90870817a24.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5e90870817a24.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br><u>F. 192/7</u> 9 and 2 open, with grapes and without fruit<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5e908b2974fe1.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5e908b2974fe1.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br><u>F. 192/8</u> 9 and 2 open, without grapes and without fruit<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5e908be79db64.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5e908be79db64.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br><u>F. 192/9</u> 9 and 2 close, without grapes and without fruit<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5e908df45c534.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5e908df45c534.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br><br><strong><u>1933</u></strong> 9 open and 9 close<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5e908f66a45bc.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5e908f66a45bc.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5e908f6f21b14.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5e908f6f21b14.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br><br><strong><u>1939</u></strong> Mint of Paris and Bruxelles<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5e9090587b3d4.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5e9090587b3d4.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5e909066cc10b.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5e909066cc10b.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
